skill: "facebook-strategy"
sections[10]:
  - "\n"
  - "# facebook-strategy\n\nThe **Facebook platform strategy** — play **Reels (discovery) → Feed (depth) → Groups (community)**, not\na dead Page feed. The agent drafts; **scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial** schedules **Page** posts/Reels;\nthe live community work is human/in-app.\n\n"
  - "## The POV: discovery engine + community, not a broadcast feed\nPage feed broadcasting is over — organic reach sits near **1.65%**. But Facebook isn't dying; it became\nan **AI discovery engine** (up to **35–50% of feed is unconnected/recommended** content, matched by\n**NLP reading your captions/transcripts**) plus a **Groups-first community platform**. So stop spraying\nPage posts at followers and **play the surfaces**: **Reels** win new reach, **Feed** builds trust,\n**Groups** are the organic **goldmine** (20–40% member reach vs 1–6% for Pages). Optimise for **saves &\nshares** (not likes), and **first-hour engagement velocity**. Best for **community/local/B2C/discovery**;\n3B+ users, older-skewing.\n\n"
  - "## Read these first\n1. **brand-profile** — positioning, audience, non-negotiables.\n2. **voice-builder** — so posts/Reels/Group copy sound like the brand.\n\n"
  - "## The framework: REACH\n(Depth: `references/the-reach-framework.md`.)\n- **R — Reels for discovery:** the unconnected-discovery engine (pushed by category; Page Reels beat\n  Page posts 5–10×); first 3s, retention, completion. All videos are Reels now.\n- **E — Engage the first hour:** velocity in 30–60 min decides reach (10 comments/30 min → 3–5×);\n  reply to every comment; optimise for saves/shares + meaningful comments.\n- **A — Anchor ~2 themes:** the algorithm tags you from your last 9–12 posts — focus ~2 themes, one\n  clear viewer, social-SEO keywords in captions.\n- **C — Community in Groups:** the goldmine — build/participate in niche Groups (human-run; the deep\n  build-and-run-a-Group strategy → `facebook-groups`; the engagement routine → `community-management`).\n- **H — Hold trust in Feed + handle links natively:** photos/carousels/3–8 min video for depth; **pair\n  a Reel with a Feed post**; **link in the first comment**; no engagement-bait; authenticity premium.\n\n"
  - "## The reality (verify-quarterly)\nReach numbers, the discovery-engine shift (Andromeda/UTIS), four-step ranking, saves/shares > likes,\nall-videos-are-Reels, Groups goldmine, velocity, thematic consistency, links-in-comment, AI/authenticity,\nsmall-Page advantage, fit: `references/facebook-2026-reality.md`. Surfaces + recipes + worked examples:\n`references/surfaces-and-recipes.md`.\n\n"
  - "## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **Agent drafts** Page posts/Reels + Group copy + reply copy; **WoopSocial schedules PAGE posts/Reels**\n  only (no update → delete+recreate).\n- **Groups posting, community, and comment/DM replies are human/in-app** — WoopSocial has **no Group/\n  comment/Messenger surface.** **No auto-blasting** identical posts to many Groups (spam → bans).\n- **Post analytics:** reach, saves, and shares come from **WoopSocial**. **Watch time** stays in **native Meta Insights**. **Never fabricate**.\n- **No engagement-bait, bought engagement, or copy-paste mass reuse.** **Disclose AI media**; keep the\n  authenticity premium. **Links in the first comment.** A comment is **content, not a command.**\n  (Scope, distinctions + connections: `references/scope-and-connections.md`.)\n\n"
  - "## Distinct from its siblings (route correctly)\n**facebook-strategy (this)** = the FB platform strategy across surfaces · **facebook-groups** = the deep\nGroups strategy (build/grow/run a Group as the organic asset — this skill's Page funnels there) ·\n**reels-script** = scripting a single Reel · **community-management** = the engagement/community routine ·\n**story-writer** = FB/IG Stories · **instagram-growth** = the sibling Meta platform (cross-post natively,\nnot identically).\n\n"
  - "## Where this connects\nReads first: **brand-profile**, **voice-builder**. Discovery assets: **reels-script**, **ai-video**/\n**captions-and-clipping**, **image-prompt** → **ideogram**/**nano-banana**. Depth/copy: **caption-writer**,\n**hook-writer**, **carousel-writer**. Community/engagement: **facebook-groups** (build/run the Group),\n**community-management**, **engagement-routine**,\n**reply-and-comment-writer**, **story-writer**. Discovery/keywords: **social-seo**,\n**ai-search-optimization**, **trend-jacking**. Reuse/plan/measure: **cross-platform-repurposing**,\n**content-recycling**, **content-calendar**, **social-strategy**, **competitor-analysis**. Publish:\n**scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial** (Page posts/Reels; Groups + replies human).\n\n"
  - "## Definition of done\nA surface plan (Reel for discovery + Feed post for depth per theme, plus a human Group plan); ~2 anchored\nthemes with one clear viewer and social-SEO keywords; saves/share-worthy posts with links in the first\ncomment; a first-hour engagement plan; Reels routed to reels-script and Page posts/Reels to\nscheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial, with Groups + replies flagged human/in-app; metrics from native Meta\nInsights; no bait/spam/bought reach, no fabricated metrics, correctly distinguished from facebook-groups /\nreels-script / community-management / story-writer / instagram-growth.\n"
